{"id":"3d4231874a161ab6","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-strong-truth.md","title":"算术非保守真理理论","display":"df-strong-truth — 算术非保守真理理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-strong-truth","aliases":["91-df-strong-truth"],"display":"df-strong-truth — 算术非保守真理理论","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-theory]]","[[91-df-truth-extension]]","[[91-df-conservative-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-strong-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-strong-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strong-truth — 算术非保守真理理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c05617254d3afc97\" href=\"?note=c05617254d3afc97\" title=\"91-df-truth-extension\">91-df-truth-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-strong-truth-—-算术非保守真理理论-$\\mathrm{StrongTh}$\">df-strong-truth — 算术非保守真理理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongTh}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongTh}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\)</span> (含真理谓词的理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (基础理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathcal L_S}(\\mathcal T_T/S)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathcal L_S}(\\mathcal T_T/S)\\)</span> (理论扩展关系)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\)</span> (基础语言句子集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StrongTh}(\\mathcal T_T,S)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathcal L_S}(\\mathcal T_T/S)\n\\land\\mathcal L_S\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\n\\land\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\varphi\\land S\\nvdash\\varphi\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StrongTh}(\\mathcal T_T,S)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathcal L_S}(\\mathcal T_T/S)\n\\land\\mathcal L_S\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\n\\land\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\varphi\\land S\\nvdash\\varphi\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里的“强”只按基础语言后果定义，即“不保守”。它不自动表示语义更好、\n更可靠，也不自动给出某个指定的一致性句；后者需要独立证明。</p>\n<p>对 PA 的标准版本而言，TB、UTB 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 是保守理论，\n不能列作本定义的例子。含充分真理语言归纳的 KF、FS 和 VF 有新的\n算术后果，可在明确版本与比较语言后作为非保守例子。\n其中 FS 还具有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致性，因此证明强度也不能替代可靠性评价。</p>\n<p>若某真理理论确实证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 在第二不完备定理的\n适用条件下不能证明它，这可以见证非保守性；反过来，仅由非保守性的\n存在量词定义不能推出见证必定是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-strong-truth-—-算术非保守真理理论-$\\mathrm{StrongTh}$","text":"df-strong-truth — 算术非保守真理理论 $\\mathrm{StrongTh}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-extension","status":"resolved","id":"c05617254d3afc97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongTh}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathcal L_S}(\\mathcal T_T/S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StrongTh}(\\mathcal T_T,S)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathcal L_S}(\\mathcal T_T/S)\n\\land\\mathcal L_S\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\n\\land\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\varphi\\land S\\nvdash\\varphi\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false}],"bytes":1703,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-strong-truth]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-strong-truth]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[